Lay a pressure triggered trap that explodes into a radius 2 wave of razor sharp wire, doing [156, 188, 212, 232, 250 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] physical damage. Those struck by the wire may be shredded, reducing accuracy, armor and defence by [18, 22, 25, 27, 30 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)].

This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.
